I need to work on the following four Jira tickets:

- IN-7765
- IN-7766
- IN-7767
- IN-7768

You already have access to Jira, GitHub, the relevant repositories, and other necessary integrations.

Your objective in this session is to perform a comprehensive technical assessment of these four tickets, understand their requirements and dependencies, recommend the safest and most efficient implementation and branching strategy, and generate execution-ready prompts that I can use in separate Claude Code sessions.

